"quote": "offerte",
"invoice": "factuur",
"Make your quote.": "Maak je offerte.",
"<a href=\"account.html\">log in</a> to keep all your quotes and invoices on your desk.": "<a href=\"account.html\">log in</a> om al je offertes en facturen op je desk te bewaren.",
"fill it in, check your quote, download it as a pdf. nothing leaves your device. what you charge is always your call.": "vul het in, check je offerte, download hem als pdf. er verlaat niets je apparaat. wat jij vraagt, bepaal jij.",
