"usage is money. write it out: where, how long, which countries. \"unlimited time, region and media\" is the most expensive buy-out there is, so price it like one.": "usage is geld. schrijf het uit: waar, hoe lang, welke landen. \"onbeperkte tijd, regio en media\" is de duurste buy-out die er is, dus prijs hem ook zo.",
"expenses": "onkosten",
